ctivities</div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"fa fa-question-circle fa-2x taxonomy-field-documentation  multi-language-content content-tr\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"fa fa-question-circle fa-2x taxonomy-field-documentation  multi-language-content content-en\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td class=\"taxonomy-context-value col-order-class-3 multi-language-content content-tr\" style=\"display: table-cell;\"><div><div class=\"gwt-Label taxonomy-label-field standardLabel\">Şirketin cirosunu ve karlılığını olumlu etkileyecektir.</div></div></td><td class=\"taxonomy-context-value col-order-class-4 multi-language-content content-en\" style=\"display: none;\"><div><div class=\"gwt-Label taxonomy-label-field standardLabel\">This will positively impact the company's revenue and profitability.</div></div></td></tr><tr class=\"oda-12000_New-Business-Relation-row-16 abstract-row\"><td class=\"taxonomy-field-name-cell\"><div class=\"gwt-Label taxonomy-field-name\">oda_ExplanationSection|</div></td><td class=\"taxonomy-dimensional-context-cell\"></td><td class=\"taxonomy-field-title\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" class=\"taxonomy-title-panel taxonomy-abstract-title standardLabel\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"gwt-HTML\"><span class=\"space\"> </span></div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"gwt-Label multi-language-content content-tr\" style=\"display: block;\">Açıklamalar</div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"gwt-Label multi-language-content content-en\" style=\"display: none;\">Explanations</div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"fa fa-question-circle fa-2x taxonomy-field-documentation  multi-language-content content-tr\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"fa fa-question-circle fa-2x taxonomy-field-documentation  multi-language-content content-en\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td class=\"taxonomy-table-black-cell\"></td><td class=\"taxonomy-table-black-cell\"></td></tr><tr class=\"oda-12000_New-Business-Relation-row-17 data-input-row alternate-row presentation-enabled\"><td class=\"taxonomy-field-name-cell\"><div class=\"gwt-Label taxonomy-field-name\">oda_ExplanationTextBlock|</div></td><td class=\"taxonomy-dimensional-context-cell\"></td><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"taxonomy-context-value-summernote multi-language-content content-tr\" style=\"display: table-cell;\"><div><div><div class=\"text-block-value\"><div>Şirketimiz, yurt içi yerleşik bir şirketten bugün (27.10.2026) kırma eleme tesisi siparişi almıştır. Sipariş bedelleri toplamı KDV hariç 1.325.000 (BirMilyonÜçYüzYirmiBeşBin) EUR 'dır. &#160;</div><div><span style=\"lineheight: 1.42857;\">Kamuoyuna saygıyla duyurulur.</span></div><div><span style=\"lineheight: 1.42857;\">İşbu açıklamanın İngilizce çevirisi de eş zamanlı olarak kamuoyuna açıklanmış olup, metinler arasında herhangi bir farklılık olması durumunda Türkçe versiyon esas alınacaktır.</span></div><div><br/></div></div></div></div></td><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"taxonomy-context-value-summernote multi-language-content content-en\" style=\"display: none;\"><div><div><div class=\"text-block-value\"><div>Our company has received an order for a crushing and screening plant from a domestic company today (October 27, 2026). The total value of the order, excluding VAT, is 1,325,000 (One Million Three Hundred Twenty-Five Thousand) EUR.</div><div><span style=\"lineheight: 1.42857;\">This is respectfully announced to the public.</span></div><div><span style=\"lineheight: 1.42857;\">The English translation of this disclosure has been publicly announced simultaneously, and in the event of any discrepancy between the texts of the disclosures, the Turkish version shall prevail.</span></div><div><br/></div></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>"],"attachments":[]}]